{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.13","index":13,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.13.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Jalan Suci itu tidak jauh dari manusia. Bila orang memaksudkan Jalan Suci itu ialah hal yang menjauhi manusia, itu bukan Jalan Suci. (Bc. IVB: 10)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.13.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：‘"},{"pinyin":"fá","traditional":"伐","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kē","traditional":"柯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fá","traditional":"伐","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kē","traditional":"柯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。’"},{"modern":"执","pinyin":"zhí","traditional":"執","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kē","traditional":"柯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fá","traditional":"伐","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kē","traditional":"柯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"nì","traditional":"睨","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"视","pinyin":"shì","traditional":"視","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"犹","pinyin":"yóu","traditional":"猶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"gǎi","traditional":"改","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"止","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, 'Buatlah tangkai kapak dengan kapak, contohnya tidak jauh.' Buatlah tangkai kapak dengan kapak. Dengan kapak mengapak tangkai kapak; bila dipandang selintas, nampak jauh juga. Maka, seorang Junzi - Kuncu dengan Kemanusiaan mengatur manusia, dan berhenti hanya setelah dapat memperbaiki kesalahannya. (I. 15.5.2)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.13.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"忠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"恕","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"违","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"違","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shī","traditional":"施","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"己","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"愿","pinyin":"yuàn","traditional":"願","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"亦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"勿","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shī","traditional":"施","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Satya dan tepasarira (tahu menimbang) itu tidak jauh dari Jalan Suci. Apa yang tidak diharapkan mengena diri sendiri, janganlah diberikan kepada orang lain. (S.S. IV: 15; V:12)"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.13.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sì","traditional":"四","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qiū","traditional":"丘","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"未","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"一","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qiú","traditional":"求","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","typ